title: insanity_mystic_root
---
<<AutoResolveNextLine>>
Mystic: greeting #dredge_ui #exit #line:insanity_mystic_greeting
<<jump insanity_mystic_menu>>
===

title: insanity_mystic_menu
---
-> ask #repeat #line:insanity_mystic_opt_ask
    <<if insanity_has_compass()>>
        <<AutoResolveNextLine>>
        Mystic: already #dredge_ui #exit #line:insanity_mystic_compass_already
    <<else>>
        Mystic: intro #dredge_ui #exit #line:insanity_mystic_compass_intro
        Mystic: offer #dredge_ui #exit #line:insanity_mystic_compass_offer
        <<insanity_clear_expected>>
        <<insanity_set_consume_aberrations>>
        <<insanity_set_required_distinct_aberrations 5>>
        <<ShowQuestGrid insanity_compass_grid>>
        <<if insanity_was_submitted() and insanity_distinct_aberrations_met()>>
            <<AutoResolveNextLine>>
            Mystic: done #dredge_ui #exit #line:insanity_mystic_compass_done
            <<insanity_grant_compass>>
        <<else>>
            <<AutoResolveNextLine>>
            Mystic: fail #dredge_ui #exit #line:insanity_mystic_compass_fail
        <<endif>>
    <<endif>>
    <<jump insanity_mystic_menu>>

-> leave #exit #line:insanity_mystic_opt_leave
    Mystic: farewell #dredge_ui #exit #line:insanity_mystic_opt_leave_resp
===
